cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "NormEval: A Meta-Evaluation of Normative Ethics Benchmarks for Large Language Models"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: dataset
date-released: "2026-04-13"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/cjimmylin/cei-literature"
url: "https://cjimmylin.github.io/cei-normeval-dashboard-v3/"
keywords:
  - normative ethics
  - LLM evaluation
  - benchmark meta-evaluation
  - AI ethics
  - moral reasoning
  - care ethics
  - knowledge-judgment divergence
abstract: >-
  A systematic meta-evaluation of 54 normative ethics benchmarks for
  large language models, characterizing each along 26 features organized
  into four axes (Normative Depth, Practical Ease, Citation Impact,
  Metadata) with composite scoring and 15 implementation trials.
